{
  "authority_effect": "NONE",
  "evidence_effect": "NONE",
  "chapter": 93,
  "title": "贾宝玉候讯归寒舍　王熙凤病笃辞人世",
  "title_status": "TG工作回目",
  "source": {
    "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
    "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
    "lines": [
      832,
      890
    ],
    "byte_range": [
      33800,
      35905
    ],
    "text_sha256": "73414569d9140f8a1b5bc92024765bf91fa7d94e9303bf92fef7b0337e1e0758"
  },
  "card_fields": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "name": "硬节点",
      "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR29凤姐短命；当前93为凤死是C级现行排程；R37/R38巧姐线从此转由平儿保护。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          837,
          839
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          33921,
          34043
        ],
        "text_sha256": "0296a869f06695cc2bf468405bca8879e9f4c3a803873c67f7decca611c6a32f"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "name": "最强处",
      "text": "**2｜最强处**  \n宝玉回家第一件事是热饭、洗手、换衣；凤姐死后两张纸仍是买米/巧姐药钱；钥匙有些已无柜可开；平儿被叫去补白布。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          840,
          842
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34043,
          34225
        ],
        "text_sha256": "efa37f4b209fe5a191064f129e6a0b8ee8b28df41dedd5cf00f176dc9873bc75"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "name": "最薄处",
      "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n释放手续、凤姐死前“最后一件管事”、死后“谁来主丧”可以更清。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          843,
          845
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34225,
          34340
        ],
        "text_sha256": "d260746d432ea4ea17f3e8ce6844e215bca76547ca9f02df20e9306c25c6f783"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          846,
          848
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34340,
          34520
        ],
        "text_sha256": "24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n宝玉/宝钗/麝月A线；凤姐/平儿/巧姐/医者/婆子B线。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          849,
          851
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34520,
          34607
        ],
        "text_sha256": "bbf552991c41fb791958c2408cc605faeb7a360a78f0e85e97bc015a375c6d57"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n38禁补。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          852,
          854
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34607,
          34637
        ],
        "text_sha256": "d7207cfdc40358c5b738d63c52fd413318c96c4148be864cd4c0cc0d7d889a5c"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "诗文身份",
      "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \nG11凤姐临终诗/忏悔文淘汰；作者挽诗无。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          855,
          857
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34637,
          34717
        ],
        "text_sha256": "eece0456252fc3d1e6e2c5f896a7d1fa635a40e2adc98b970074aa370d119c14"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "name": "笑料",
      "text": "**8｜笑料**  \n麝月说“第三日我自己饿了先吃半碗”可保，形成“回家”活气；凤死后笑料退场。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          858,
          860
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34717,
          34847
        ],
        "text_sha256": "82e58ec44e300720aa1a2725f4f03a4b9ff2f0d6fa0395c2d67f733bda98006c"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "name": "宗教/梦",
      "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n凤姐可说怕、命、报，但不作报应裁决；不写病中审判梦。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          861,
          863
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34847,
          34948
        ],
        "text_sha256": "e01b0ebcdf52c8b45fec3c1903ab60916809614e63b39ebee8621c0cc1d6142b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n医者、抓药、白事执行者；丧务比过去简陋。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          864,
          866
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          34948,
          35028
        ],
        "text_sha256": "65a580973cae786f4633de0eed353709abd035ec95c00ad4d68f728844547fc5"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "name": "四链",
      "text": "**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          867,
          869
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          35028,
          35195
        ],
        "text_sha256": "2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "name": "必须保留",
      "text": "**12｜必须保留**  \n热粥、巧姐问薄不薄、空药吊子、白布短一截、平儿起身去办。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          870,
          872
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          35195,
          35305
        ],
        "text_sha256": "83d1dcf9f335e7fa03c6553c1d6649d486aea624c3973611c3d120a4f5894663"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n凤姐“机关算尽”自我总结、玄奇吐血、恢弘大丧。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          873,
          875
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          35305,
          35394
        ],
        "text_sha256": "158fbb0475de9d26e0e0da1d16bf66bd596fe74f12f70bdec0deb8de8d64eff6"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3",
      "text": "**14｜L3**  \n双线可更紧交叉，仍属L2。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          876,
          878
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          35394,
          35445
        ],
        "text_sha256": "019ff5d1e235bce6ecfb239647a302ec5892b5e2c8e69d9f2316858f95988937"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "name": "前80同构",
      "text": "**15｜前80同构**  \n凤姐过去主持他人丧礼；本回用“她自己的丧事没有凤姐可找”反打。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          879,
